WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.110
Three drops. By morning, truth go come
out.

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.930
Mama cook am for you herself! Pepper soup
special!

3
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.250
Since when Mama dey cook for me?

4
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.130
Drink am, my daughter. E good for belle.

5
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.450
Oya now.

6
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.500
Wait… wetin be this?

7
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.510
Jesus!

8
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.450
Mama, wetin you put inside this soup?!

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.510
Na anointing! Anointing! Anointing dey
bitter small!

10
00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.300
Ehn ehn! Wahala don land!

11
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.240
Olorun mi!

12
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.820
Ada… I no like this one at all.

13
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.700
Show me.

14
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.550
Mama, you first. Na you cook am.

15
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.700
Na that day I know say… the soup no be for
me alone.
